  "question": "Where\u2019s the closest attraction positioned on the way to Charlesmark Hotel, Boston, MA from Blue Ocean Discovery Center, Hampton, NH?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-70.810543 42.909869)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.078568 42.349998)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'attraction'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-70.810543 42.909869)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-70.810543 42.909869)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
